{"agency_id": "ministry-of-health", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/health.govt.nz/post/3lye5ng3im22g", "captured_at": "2026-06-24T22:27:16+00:00", "content": "This FASD Awareness Day, we're publishing an action plan aimed at preventing FASD and improving support for families and people living with FASD.\n\nLearn more: www.health.govt.nz/strategies-i...", "content_hash": "d4dcbb500f9d48af6b6df24921c88fb7e352ab76b5abcd18f6ec3cc3ce5ef581", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:nyyntdr37nga3w4lq4kba6la/app.bsky.feed.post/3lye5ng3im22g", "cid": "bafyreibmvot3aodsu4hetcmbsiauskdwavxippb6px7cpr6p53h5bc537e", "source_id": "ministry-of-health-bluesky-c521eae2"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "blue tile with white text in the centre which reads fetal alcohol spectrum disorder action plan now published", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:nyyntdr37nga3w4lq4kba6la/bafkreihm7pcp3vjxrmymy6id3cg6gen6yrdenqgeglxhio4m4gmdlkqq7e", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:nyyntdr37nga3w4lq4kba6la/bafkreihm7pcp3vjxrmymy6id3cg6gen6yrdenqgeglxhio4m4gmdlkqq7e"}], "original_created_at": "2025-09-08T21:30:49.959Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw\\bluesky\\2025-09\\3lye5ng3im22g.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lye5ng3im22g", "source_account": "health.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/health.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lzmdom75as2f", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "Kia kaha to the Cape Palliser communities 🌊 Hopefully, the vehicle ban is a step toward protecting taonga, honouring mana whenua, and ensuring access for all. Herenga ā Nuku supports inclusive solutions that respect people and land. #publicaccess #CapePalliser www.stuff.co.nz/nz-news/3608...", "content_hash": "fa804a9e5c934f37cbbea5bb1f9decac17a83e418f1d23cd3d70509b97a0a63d", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lzmdom75as2f", "cid": "bafyreid3oqhepkybgoik3rlkawi3pcxpbm7ccgxrnitjl7y7zd6sla5cka", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-09-24T21:05:21.911Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-09/3lzmdom75as2f.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lzmdom75as2f", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lyeuzd3fbk2e", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "... and thirdly, a thousand hectares of public access easements have been added, through the work our operations team do to manually authorise their inclusion in the public access data.", "content_hash": "666089a8993f771efed52b7a33fae165407d824e113c07d263dcb89911929d9c", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lyeuzd3fbk2e", "cid": "bafyreichfk4hjltfoka63dvbnjhcksg6tuwjjpjhhs5helc73mv7cxx3i4", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-09-09T04:29:05.527Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-09/3lyeuzd3fbk2e.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lyeuzd3fbk2e", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lyeuyqede22e", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "...Secondly, we have newly identified a thousand hectares of esplanade reserves because of the data pipeline referencing 14 data sources, as opposed to the one source we used originally...", "content_hash": "c100884de7e9a85c43f619e3f2ffa1befc08c518438aef8a38d43c30c92597da", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lyeuyqede22e", "cid": "bafyreih7pyen6a525y7wzihabgi7rqunwhggzxdcpmvx7tu2cy5fwrr4ny", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-09-09T04:28:45.897Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-09/3lyeuyqede22e.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lyeuyqede22e", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lyeuy4sots2e", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "For example, we have added thousands of new reserves to the data set. Firstly, by securing data supply from a lot more councils than previously...", "content_hash": "0c832a0fb9ee70a485297da10bf6162515dfe2949429d1a171c93d20a7629302", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lyeuy4sots2e", "cid": "bafyreiazvcslm3qebcbfo6g4ncherou747yy3jwyikhyg4wqwdcalpdtee", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-09-09T04:28:25.396Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-09/3lyeuy4sots2e.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lyeuy4sots2e", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lyeuv653lc2e", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "Two years of specialised work by our #GIS and operations experts have enabled us to automatically identify #publicaccess where it exists in most NZ land parcels. This means our data set is more accurate and comprehensive because we can deal with exponentially more information.", "content_hash": "e7693e3f606187c171ed663aebf570592b106e7a43fa5c8e447bef5acc0e8134", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lyeuv653lc2e", "cid": "bafyreibjiaejvnwsqsgyu3nbkpcdkwfpkvpkqdenvpqivcjbsmnzqrdi7q", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-09-09T04:26:46.121Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-09/3lyeuv653lc2e.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lyeuv653lc2e", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lyeutjzo5s2e", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "The upgraded map and dataset help New Zealanders explore the outdoors with greater confidence and clarity. It is a free, accurate, and comprehensive public service for walkers, cyclists, horse riders, hunters, other recreationists and land managers.", "content_hash": "8393bb8f893cf7599868c05d165d9214b15d753febecba4efcfb801dee4c7eaf", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lyeutjzo5s2e", "cid": "bafyreidxkiozm3wm5px3h6gw757w32n6gjenoxsrlwqy3mb6lmbkf26ytu", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-09-09T04:25:51.484Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-09/3lyeutjzo5s2e.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lyeutjzo5s2e", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
